This project downloads and builds Azgaar's Fantasy Map Generator at install
time (it is not included in this repository). Azgaar's Fantasy Map Generator is
Copyright (c) Azgaar and contributors, distributed under the MIT License:
https://github.com/Azgaar/Fantasy-Map-Generator

The font files in overlay/fonts come from the @fontsource packages and are
distributed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (see overlay/fonts/licenses).
